/E (Sensor data reaches the other layers in two ways. The live feed \(/events\) is an open connection on which the Twin pushes one readings event per tick. Tool calls such as get_readings answer individual requests. Each layer also writes a log file in a shared format, one JSON object per line. These files are merged into one log per run \(see Part 1\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [19]
>>
