148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (All three layers are Python services built on FastAPI. Each offers its functions as MCP tools. MCP \(Model Context Protocol\) is a standard that lets a program publish tools which other programs can list and call. The three layers use the same protocol version \(2026-07-28\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
149 0 obj
<<
