228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (Two kinds of limit restrict the effect of a single request. An action may touch at most 30 % of a domain's nodes, with a minimum of 2: Traffic 3, Water 2, Power 2 and Emergency 2. Isolating sensors is capped at 50 %: Traffic 5, Water 4, Air Quality 4 and Emergency 3. Power is the only exception and may isolate all 9 nodes after a serious electrical threat, because isolating a sensor removes its data and never opens a switch.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
