230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (A reported sensor value is the sum of three components: the true value, the bias of the individual device and random noise. The true value follows slow waves of 5 to 20 simulated minutes around a base level. Only the reported value leaves the Twin. The true value stays inside the Twin and is written to a private file that is never merged or shared. A test verifies that no tool, feed or log line exposes it.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
