/E (A reported value depends only on the seed, the device and the tick number. Two runs with the same seed and the same scenarios therefore produce identical data, which makes scenarios repeatable and logs comparable. The clock is simulated. One tick equals one simulated second and runs at real speed, starting at 2026-10-05T08:00:00.000Z. Every reading carries the tick number and an RFC 3339 timestamp. congestion_index is a third traffic sensor, in percent, that follows the vehicle count at the same node.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [17]
>>
