/P 107 0 R
/E (The runtime separates transport, scenario detection, planning, validation, Guardian authorization, and Twin execution. Twin discovery supplies the current nodes, actions, caps and clock. CIVIS retains original reading IDs, units, null values and multi-domain membership throughout the flow. It uses Twin simulated time for evidence freshness and token lifetime, while network calls and Gemini timeouts use real monotonic seconds.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
