/E (Partner addresses and Bearer keys are local configuration, never hard-coded. The standard peer call limit is three real seconds. Gemini planning has a 60-real-second limit. The default evidence age is 10 simulated seconds, extended to 60 only by the explicit mock profile. A Guardian token is valid for at most 60 simulated seconds. A lost execution reply keeps the outcome uncertain, so CIVIS reuses the original idempotency key and does not invent a new command.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
