/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (The tagged S02 water action is restricted to set_valve_position on WAT-01 at 40 percent, with a Twin preview of the exact command. The Brain makes that preview call; the Twin enforces its 60-tick and one-commit rule. For S05, the Guardian requires an Emergency/R2 ambulance dispatch to the discovered carrier, for one unit, with both the medical incident reading and a trusted ambulance units_free reading included as evidence.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
447 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
