/P 112 0 R
/T (Known limitations)
/E (Known limitations)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
474 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (The Random Forest was trained on synthetic data; it is not evidence of real-world security performance. It has no units_free training feature, so its advisory is unavailable for that sensor. Deterministic Guardian scoring remains available.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
475 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (Readings, verdicts, reputation and token replay state are held in memory, so a restart does not restore that state. Local checks use in-process peers or mocked partner effects and do not establish that a live Twin and Brain deployment has completed a joint run. The latest Guardian follow-up log records compilation and Brain-notice mapping and configuration checks as passed; it does not record a pytest run or live joint gate.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [9]
>>
