578 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (The connectivity check ran the partners' packages unchanged: 28 passed, 0 failed, 1 skipped. It covered the live feed, the tools, the city graph, the Brain's start-up checks and a real Guardian token, which the Twin accepted and then refused on reuse. It did not cover the Brain acting through the Guardian.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
579 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (On 7 and 8 Nov we ran the real traffic jam \(T2\) with all three real layers five times \(T2-5 to T2-9\). Only T2-8 and T2-9 are fully clean, because the first runs picked up old log data. Each link between layers works at network level. The chain stops before the Twin commits an action. The Guardian handles readings more slowly than the Twin produces them, so some verdict lookups fail. The Brain's plan for the shared node SH-05 is refused because there is no air quality cap, and the Brain's AI budget runs out. We have the logs and know who owns each issue. We have not recorded a successful joint run. T1 passed with the real Twin and Brain. T4 and T6 passed only with a stand-in Guardian. The logs are in logs/.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
