1416 0 obj
<<
/Title (Triplet 04 consists of three services that cooperate through a shared interface. The Twin \(team Trinity\) simulates a city of 38 nodes, each carrying sensors and, in some cases, an actuator. The City Brain \(team CIVIS\) reads the sensor data, detects incidents and selects a response. The Guardian \(team 9antra\) assesses whether each reading can be trusted and signs a permission for the actions it approves. The Twin executes an action only when it receives a valid permission for that exact action.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 977 0 R
>>
endobj
